        "speaker": "B",
        "text": "Today we're taking a glassblowing class."
      },
      {
        "start": 10.211,
        "end": 19.717,
        "speaker": "C",
        "text": "I'm sweating already. We've worked with a lot of materials before, but we've only scratched the surface when it comes to glass. And that's because it's a little intimidating."
      },
      {
        "start": 19.973,
