        "speaker": "D",
        "text": "So I am Nicholas Noble, or Nick. I've been working here at Umberley Glassworks for about 3 years. I've been blowing glass in total for about 9. I got my degree in glassblowing from the University of South Alabama and excited to do these classes with y'all."
      },
      {
        "start": 42.832,
